<title>USA: Horizon Group Q3 shr down to $0.28.</title>
<headline>Horizon Group Q3 shr down to $0.28.</headline>
<dateline>NORTON SHORES, Mich 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.28		    $0.36</p>
<p> FFO shr	   $0.64		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net		  7,495		    9,078</p>
<p> Revs		38,651		   33,810</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  26,762		   25,541</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Net shr	    $1.04		    $1.06</p>
<p> FFO shr	     2.03		     1.95</p>
<p> Net		  27,064		   26,999</p>
<p> Revs		112,870		   95,585</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   26,007		   25,445</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Horizon Group Inc.</p>
<p>FFO stands for Funds From Operations.</p>
<p>1996 FFO figure based on the March 1995 new NAREIT definition of FFO.</p>
<p>Figures are pro forma so that July 14, 1995 merger with McArthur/Glen Realty Corp  MCG.N is treated as if it was completed on January 1, 1995.</p>
<p>1996 and 1995 net income and net income per share figures include a combined total of more than $600,000 in extraordinary charges.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
